<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Projects on ftvkyo</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/</link><description>Recent content in Projects on ftvkyo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-GB</language><atom:link href="https://ftvkyo.me/project/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Home floorplans</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/floorplans/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/floorplans/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="russia-19992019"&gt;Russia, 1999–2019&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Dates are approximate.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;aside&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Missing data:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Chernogolovka&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Moscow, Yuzhnoye Butovo&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Moscow, Severnoye Butovo&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To be added:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol start="4"&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Korolyov, 2005&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Moscow, Kurjanovo, 2006&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Moscow, Severnoye Izmaylovo, 2007&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Chernogolovka x2, 2008–2013&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Moscow, Severnoye Izmaylovo, 2013–2014&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Shchyolkovo, 2014–2016&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Chernogolovka (back), 2016–2017&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Dolgoprudny x3, 2017–2019&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/aside&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="asia-20192021"&gt;Asia, 2019–2021&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="philippines-january-2020"&gt;Philippines, January 2020&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2020-01-01-Philippines.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="hong-kong-september-2020"&gt;Hong Kong, September 2020&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2020-09-01-HongKong.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;aside&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To be added:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Hong Kong, December 2020–August 2021&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/aside&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="uk-2021now"&gt;UK, 2021–now&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="cambridge-september-2021"&gt;Cambridge, September 2021&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2021-09-01-Cambridge.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="edinburgh-september-2022"&gt;Edinburgh, September 2022&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2022-09-10-Edinburgh_hu_bf60e02d5112e9af.webp"&#10; alt="" width="1600" height="2016"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="edinburgh-march-2023"&gt;Edinburgh, March 2023&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2023-03-09-Edinburgh.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="edinburgh-august-2023"&gt;Edinburgh, August 2023&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2023-08-27-Edinburgh.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="edinburgh-november-2024"&gt;Edinburgh, November 2024&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2024-11-13-Edinburgh.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="edinburgh-may-2025"&gt;Edinburgh, May 2025&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/floorplans/2025-05-04-Edinburgh.svg"&#10; alt=""&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>Lazy keymap</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/lazy-keymap/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/lazy-keymap/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Github repository: &lt;a href="https://github.com/ftvkyo/lazy-keymap"&gt;ftvkyo/lazy-keymap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Work started: &lt;em&gt;Dec 5, 2023&lt;/em&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Code recreated based on a previous implementation written in Python&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;And then again, but with a better approach to getting things done&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="info skills"&gt;&#10; &lt;span&gt;&#10; &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor" d="m6.914 2.741 15.557 15.556-4.243 4.243L2.672 6.983zm-.707-.707L4.174 0 0 4.243l1.965 2.034zm12.821 21.119L24 24l-.918-4.901zM14.461 7.459l.389-.388.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.708-.708-.707-.706 2.121-2.121 2.121 2.121-4.631 4.631 1.393 1.393L24 4.95 19.092 0l-6.045 6.045zm-4.949 9.193L4.95 21.213l-2.121-2.121.707-.708.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.706.319-.319-1.415-1.415L0 19.092 4.95 24l5.955-5.955zm9.934-11.349a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.707.5.5 0 0 0 .708.707"/&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Rust, ZMK, X Keyboard Config, SVG&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/lazy-keymap/refcard.svg"&#10; alt="Example reference card for my one of a kind Hovert60 keyboard"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Example reference card for my one of a kind &lt;a href="https://ftvkyo.me/post/devlog-hovert60-02/"&gt;Hovert60 keyboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>Milling calculator</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/milling/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/milling/</guid><description>&lt;aside class="warn"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Surface speed presets are &lt;strong&gt;unreliable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/aside&gt;&#10;&lt;noscript&gt;&#10;&lt;strong&gt;JavaScript is required.&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;&lt;/noscript&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10;&#10;function el(key) {&#10; return document.querySelector("input#" + key);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function clearOutputs() {&#10; el("speed").value = "";&#10; el("feedXY").value = "";&#10; el("feedZ").value = "";&#10; el("stepover").value = "";&#10; el("stepdown").value = "";&#10;}&#10;&#10;function clearEverything() {&#10; el("diameter").value = "";&#10; el("flutes").value = "";&#10; el("feed").value = "";&#10; el("chipLoad").value = "";&#10;&#10; clearOutputs();&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getInput(key) {&#10; const e = el(key);&#10;&#10; if (e &amp;&amp; e.checkValidity()) {&#10; const n = Number(e.value);&#10; if (typeof n === "number" &amp;&amp; !Number.isNaN(n) &amp;&amp; n !== 0) {&#10; return n;&#10; }&#10; }&#10; return undefined;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function update() {&#10; const diameter = getInput("diameter");&#10; const flutes = getInput("flutes");&#10; const feed = getInput("feed");&#10; const chipLoad = getInput("chipLoad");&#10;&#10; switch (undefined) {&#10; case diameter:&#10; case flutes:&#10; case feed:&#10; case chipLoad:&#10; clearOutputs();&#10; return;&#10; }&#10;&#10; const speed = 1000 * feed / (Math.PI * diameter);&#10; const feedXY = speed * flutes * chipLoad;&#10; const feedZ = feedXY / 2;&#10; const stepover = diameter * 0.45;&#10; const stepdown = diameter * 0.45;&#10;&#10; el("speed").value = speed.toFixed(0);&#10; el("feedXY").value = feedXY.toFixed(0);&#10; el("feedZ").value = feedZ.toFixed(0);&#10; el("stepover").value = stepover.toFixed(3);&#10; el("stepdown").value = stepdown.toFixed(3);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function setInput(key, value) {&#10; const e = el(key);&#10; e.value = value;&#10; update();&#10;}&#10;&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div id="calculator"&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="diameter"&gt;Tool diameter &lt;span&gt;(mm)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="diameter" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="\d*(\.\d*)?" oninput="update()"/&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="buttons"&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;1&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;1.5&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;2&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;2.5&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;3&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;4&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;5&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;6&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;7&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;8&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;9&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('diameter', this.innerText)"&gt;10&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="flutes"&gt;Number of flutes &lt;span&gt;(integer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="flutes" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="\d*" oninput="update()"/&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="buttons"&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('flutes', this.innerText)"&gt;1&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('flutes', this.innerText)"&gt;2&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('flutes', this.innerText)"&gt;3&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('flutes', this.innerText)"&gt;4&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="feed"&gt;Surface speed &lt;span&gt;(m/min)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="feed" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="\d*(\.\d*)?" oninput="update()"/&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="buttons"&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('feed', '38.1')"&gt;Acrylic (dry)&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('feed', '60.96')"&gt;Aluminium (dry)&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="chipLoad"&gt;Chip load &lt;span&gt;(mm)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="chipLoad" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="\d*(\.\d*)?" oninput="update()"/&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="buttons"&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('chipLoad', this.innerText)"&gt;0.025&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('chipLoad', this.innerText)"&gt;0.05&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('chipLoad', this.innerText)"&gt;0.075&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('chipLoad', this.innerText)"&gt;0.1&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="setInput('chipLoad', this.innerText)"&gt;0.125&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;hr/&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="speed"&gt;Spindle speed &lt;span&gt;(RPM)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="speed" type="text" readonly/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="feedXY"&gt;Feed XY &lt;span&gt;(mm/min)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="feedXY" type="text" readonly/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="feedZ"&gt;Feed Z or plunge &lt;span&gt;(mm/min)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="feedZ" type="text" readonly/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="stepover"&gt;Stepover &lt;span&gt;(mm)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="stepover" type="text" readonly/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;label for="stepdown"&gt;Stepdown &lt;span&gt;(mm)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id="stepdown" type="text" readonly/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="buttons"&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="clearEverything()"&gt;Clear&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;button onclick="update()"&gt;Update&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;hr/&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="personal-experience"&gt;Personal experience&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;There are some settings that worked well for me.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Obsidian ftvkyo</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/obsidian-ftvkyo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/obsidian-ftvkyo/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Github repository: &lt;a href="https://github.com/ftvkyo/obsidian-ftvkyo"&gt;ftvkyo/obsidian-ftvkyo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Work started: &lt;em&gt;Jul 23, 2023&lt;/em&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Code was migrated from &amp;laquo;Inline plugins&amp;raquo; I made earlier&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="info skills"&gt;&#10; &lt;span&gt;&#10; &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor" d="m6.914 2.741 15.557 15.556-4.243 4.243L2.672 6.983zm-.707-.707L4.174 0 0 4.243l1.965 2.034zm12.821 21.119L24 24l-.918-4.901zM14.461 7.459l.389-.388.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.708-.708-.707-.706 2.121-2.121 2.121 2.121-4.631 4.631 1.393 1.393L24 4.95 19.092 0l-6.045 6.045zm-4.949 9.193L4.95 21.213l-2.121-2.121.707-.708.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.706.319-.319-1.415-1.415L0 19.092 4.95 24l5.955-5.955zm9.934-11.349a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.707.5.5 0 0 0 .708.707"/&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; TypeScript (React), Electron, CSS (SASS)&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I have been using Obsidian for a while (since March 2021).&#10;Finding a good workflow, a good approach to work and study is important for me, and it is an interesting challenge.&#10;This project is the culmination of my efforts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OpenSCAD snippets</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/openscad-snippets/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/openscad-snippets/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;For now, the snippets are self-contained.&#10;That implies there may be duplicates of common functions between snippets.&#10;Even worse, the functions with the same names may work differently in different snippets.&#10;And there may be fewer comments than desired.&#10;You&amp;rsquo;ve been warned &lt;code&gt;¯\_(ツ)_/¯&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="wavy-donut"&gt;Wavy donut&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Just why did I do this?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://ftvkyo.me/img/project/openscad-snippets/wavy-donut-2.webp"&#10; alt="A render of the wavy donut with 2 waves" width="1571" height="775"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;A render of the wavy donut with 2 waves&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tekutonu</title><link>https://ftvkyo.me/project/tekutonu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ftvkyo.me/project/tekutonu/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;GitHub repository: &lt;a href="https://github.com/ftvkyo/tekutonu"&gt;ftvkyo/tekutonu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Work started: &lt;em&gt;Oct 14, 2022&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Work stopped: &lt;em&gt;Nov 20, 2022&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Timespan: 38 days, &lt;em&gt;17&lt;/em&gt; of them have commits&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="info skills"&gt;&#10; &lt;span&gt;&#10; &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill="currentColor" d="m6.914 2.741 15.557 15.556-4.243 4.243L2.672 6.983zm-.707-.707L4.174 0 0 4.243l1.965 2.034zm12.821 21.119L24 24l-.918-4.901zM14.461 7.459l.389-.388.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.708-.708-.707-.706 2.121-2.121 2.121 2.121-4.631 4.631 1.393 1.393L24 4.95 19.092 0l-6.045 6.045zm-4.949 9.193L4.95 21.213l-2.121-2.121.707-.708.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.707.707-.707.707.707.707-.707-.707-.706.319-.319-1.415-1.415L0 19.092 4.95 24l5.955-5.955zm9.934-11.349a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.707.5.5 0 0 0 .708.707"/&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10; Rust, Vulkan (vulkano.rs)&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;It is not the first time I tried to build a voxel engine.&#10;This time, the primary objective of the project was to learn the basics of Vulkan.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>